~ p3_safe_fight
Emily: Zero... four... one... seven. [#thought, #pan=0]
Emily: That's my birthday. [#thought]
Leanne: David? What are you— is that— put that away!
David: Someone's in the house. I heard the garage. [#leanne=fight_gun_leanne]
Leanne: Not in this house. Not with that. Not after—
David: ...There's no one.
Leanne: Of course there's no one. There's never anyone. Just you and that thing.
David: You wanted it here! "Just in case," Lee. Your words. In case someone broke in while I was at work.
Leanne: I wanted her safe! You gave her the code!
David: Because you asked me to!
=> END

